      "writtenOn": "2018-01-17T03:12:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Basically, PREFFERD_NETWORK_MODE + subId is used. And PREFFERD_NETWORK_MODE(Slot1, Slot2) is used for a new SIM card.\n\nIf user inserts a new SIM card into a device, we can\u0027t get the setting from PREFFERD_NETWORK_MODE + subId. So, we use PREFFERD_NETWORK_MODE(Slot1, Slot2) stored user setting based on slot.\n\nWithout this, the setting will be always default if user inserts a new SIM card.\n\nFrom usability point of view, I think it is better to use the previous setting in that case.",
      "parentUuid": "419869cb_86cf4e5a",
      "range": {
